{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-2-10","kind":"proposition","title":"中点、延长段与平方和","englishTitle":"If a straight line be bisected, and a straight line be added to it in a straight line, the square on the whole with the added straight line and the square on the added straight line both together are double of the square on the half and of the square described on the straight line made up of the half and the added straight line as on one straight line.","book":2,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","contentId":"euclid-2-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45b9b3239d59ba4a40153a150d6a9387e93f6e5926acd1689619f2b15a4372ed","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-2-10.statement","euclid-2-10.construction.1","euclid-2-10.proof.1","euclid-2-10.construction.2","euclid-2-10.proof.2","euclid-2-10.proof.3","euclid-2-10.construction.3","euclid-2-10.proof.4","euclid-2-10.proof.5","euclid-2-10.proof.6","euclid-2-10.proof.7","euclid-2-10.proof.8","euclid-2-10.proof.9","euclid-2-10.proof.10","euclid-2-10.proof.11","euclid-2-10.proof.12","euclid-2-10.proof.13","euclid-2-10.proof.14","euclid-2-10.conclusion","euclid-2-10.historical.1","euclid-2-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-2-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2029e7d527b317065a4a0a59e71d27bbbea2fd17b6c5f8592862ab916eb4a8b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be bisected, and a straight line be added to it in a straight line, the square on the whole with the added straight line and the square on the added straight line both together are double of the square on the half and of the square described on the straight line made up of the half and the added straight line as on one straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线被两截,而一条直线被加到一条直线中,则整个正方形加上一条直线,加上一条直线,加上一条正方形,这两条加在一起,是一半正方形的两倍,另一半的正方形是所描述的直线,加上一条直线,加一条直线作为一条直线。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线两平分之又任引増一线共为一全线其全线上及引増线上两直角方形并倍大于平分半线上及分馀半线偕引増线上两直角方形并"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条直线被平分，任何附加线一起形成整条线。整条线上的两个平方以及延长线上两个平方大于半线段的余数和半线及延长线两平方的余数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa2d312ee10495acf13976ac4ce287cf800a3e6a373849137d16aed90cc1d4df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a straight line AB be bisected at C, and let a straight line BD be added to it in a straight line;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将一条AB线线分成C,并将一条BD线加入一条直线;"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d978b06e018e308de18222223d234fcc929ba8b8f1557a109a06f854e72430c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the squares on AD, DB are double of the squares on AC, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,AD和DB的正方形是AC和CD的正方形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98cf68c7b692c7c56b4396b2ccb4a70051703e728b7850d421695598c9fcad58","citations":["euclid-1-11","euclid-1-3","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let CE be drawn from the point C at right angles to AB [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)], and let it be made equal to either AC or CB [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)]; let EA, EB be joined; through E let EF be drawn parallel to AD, and through D let FD be drawn parallel to CE. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CE从直角的C点抽取,相当于AC或CB;EA、EB连接;E与AD平行抽取EF,D与CE平行抽取FD。（相关点与线段：AB） [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)] [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4da37a8fe5de40563696c0289fdee3cb4a58b2c2361e4d403eca362abe98bed","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since a straight line EF falls on the parallel straight lines EC, FD, the angles CEF, EFD are equal to two right angles; [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] therefore the angles FEB, EFD are less than two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线EF横线相交了平行直线EC、FD,角度CEF、EFD等于两个直角;因此,角度FEB、EFD小于两个直角。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c37b9a43510d6bc4e2ccf382a2564d12d4083ac2701f73efae2a809304bfb16","citations":["euclid-1-post-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But straight lines produced from angles less than two right angles meet; [[I. Post. 5](/principles/euclid-1-post-5)] therefore EB, FD, if produced in the direction B, D, will meet."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但直线从小于2 直角个角度延伸,因此,EB,FD方向延伸至B,D方向,就会相互相交。 [[I. Post. 5](/principles/euclid-1-post-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"841eef4ab29981612b253f4624d45e1ff03982ec26a394aefa4be60e3b197430","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be produced and meet at G, and let AG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G时延长并相交,AG时连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09f6ff96a51bd5a15985d42c089c1514b64ad5a911b5b9a3ecd804835eed7cd2","citations":["euclid-1-5","euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AC is equal to CE, the angle EAC is also equal to the angle AEC; [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] and the angle at C is right; therefore each of the angles EAC, AEC is half a right angle. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC等于CE,EAC角度也等于AEC角度,C该角是直角,因此,每个角度的EAC,AEC是半个直角。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f2af1f0809ef24de494a6b5101f8fb4ecb772dff225195a6dfc4c1a05bf7321","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the angles CEB, EBC is also half a right angle; therefore the angle AEB is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,CEB、EBC角度各为半直角;因此,AEB该角是直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b00bc0eee88c68a724b25876eb29af08e5b6ac8cff36e645dd85b8d1c637d71","citations":["euclid-1-15","euclid-1-29","euclid-1-32","euclid-1-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle EBC is half a right angle, the angle DBG is also half a right angle. [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] But the angle BDG is also right, for it is equal to the angle DCE, they being alternate; [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] therefore the remaining angle DGB is half a right angle; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the angle DGB is equal to the angle DBG, so that the side BD is also equal to the side GD. [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EBC角是半个直角角,DBG角也是半个直角角。但是BDG角也是对的,因为它等于DCE角,它们是交替的;因此,剩余的DGB角是半个直角角;因此,DGB角等于DBG角,因此,BD角也等于GD侧。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91c01f656604a15bd96fa78ce4c1afba4e3efd7bf62db14d0c1fd52b2580ac9c","citations":["euclid-1-34","euclid-1-32","euclid-1-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the angle EGF is half a right angle, and the angle at F is right, for it is equal to the opposite angle, the angle at C, [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] the remaining angle FEG is half a right angle; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the angle EGF is equal to the angle FEG, so that the side GF is also equal to the side EF. [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于EGF角为直角角半,F角是正确的,因为与对角相等,C角为C角,其余FEG角为直角角半;因此,EGF角等于FEG角,因此,GF角也等于EF角。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b59eda95caaa17a822b2512815992fed1268785884962e86d908f8f8a57af54c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the square on EC is equal to the square on CA, the squares on EC, CA are double of the square on CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,EC的正方形等于CA的正方形,EC的正方形,EC的CA是CA的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36604527663c431c15c2268fbb110e487d9c4b4e3ecb4d24de45436ecf5fc157","citations":["euclid-1-47","euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on EA is equal to the squares on EC, CA; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the square on EA is double of the square on AC. [[C. N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EA的正方形等于EC的正方形,CA,因此EA的正方形等于AC的正方形的两倍。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] [[C. N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c2027414844c256468e0cfae46b7a0548df828a293e3d81ae9fccd4bf276a0f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since FG is equal to EF, the square on FG is also equal to the square on FE; therefore the squares on GF, FE are double of the square on EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于FG等于EF,FG等于正方形等于FE,因此GF,FE是正方形,比正方形等于EF翻了一番。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6416055e5fbf5e1b0d155abeadd63b696f5555f446f271566b3d3e2ca972177e","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on EG is equal to the squares on GF, FE; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the square on EG is double of the square on EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EG的正方形等于GF的正方形,FE,因此EG的正方形等于EF的正方形的两倍。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"daa4788dfe9fe592d502c4e1852081c6946b559508eec52ce4f57cb026ff026a","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EF is equal to CD; [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] therefore the square on EG is double of the square on CD. But the square on EA was also proved double of the square on AC; therefore the squares on AE, EG are double of the squares on AC, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF等于CD,EG的正方形是CD的正方形的两倍,但EA的正方形也是AC的正方形的两倍;AE的正方形,EG是AC的正方形的两倍。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36495fc4a96aaf8b0d6f9174fe410b24d3221bdde94315af07a6e7888844704c","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on AG is equal to the squares on AE, EG; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the square on AG is double of the squares on AC, CD. But the squares on AD, DG are equal to the square on AG; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the squares on AD, DG are double of the squares on AC, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG的正方形等于AE,EG的正方形;因此,AG的正方形等于AC,CD的正方形的两倍。 但AD,DG的正方形等于AG的正方形;AD,DG的正方形等于AC,CD的正方形的两倍。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a36bcdecaa3b87a8da271348d951781c449115b89b26b44d03e7b9874b351885","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DG is equal to DB; therefore the squares on AD, DB are double of the squares on AC, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG等于DB,因此,AD的正方形是AC,CD的正方形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":18,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":19,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd751864ebb54779bfec7e2005e32390afc47a0d9d381293ea9512b742ef6023","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线两平分之又任引増一线共为一全线其全线上及引増线上两直角方形并倍大于平分半线上及分馀半线偕引増线上两直角方形并解曰甲乙直线平分于丙又任引増为乙丁题言甲丁线上及乙丁线上两直角方形并倍大于甲丙线上及丙丁线上两直角方形并论曰试于丙上作丙戊垂线与甲丙等自戊至甲至乙各作腰线次从丁作己丁垂线引长之又从戊乙引长之遇于庚次作戊己线与丙丁平行末作甲庚线依前题论推显甲戊乙为直角丙戊乙为半直角即相对之戊庚己亦半直角〈一卷廿九〉又己为直角〈一卷卅四〉即己戊庚亦半直角〈一卷卅二〉而己戊己庚两腰必等〈一卷〉〈六〉依显乙丁丁庚两腰亦等夫甲戊上直角方形等于甲丙丙戊上两直角方形并〈一卷四七〉必倍大于甲丙上直角方形而戊庚上直角方形等于戊己己庚上两直角方形并〈一卷四七〉必倍大于对戊己边之丙丁上直角方形〈一卷卅四〉则甲戊戊庚上两直角方形并倍大于甲丙丙丁上两直角方形并也又甲庚上直角方形等于甲戊戊庚上两直角方形并亦等于甲丁丁庚上两直角方形并则甲丁丁庚上两直角方形并亦倍大于甲丙丙丁上两直角方形并也而甲丁乙丁上两直角方形并倍大于甲丙丙丁上两直角方形并矣〈丁庚与乙丁等故〉注曰以数明之设十数平分之各五又任増三为十三十三之羃一百六十九及三之羃九倍大于五之羃二十五及八之羃六十四也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平分直线，任何延长线形成整条直线。在整条直线上和延长线上，两个平方大于半段和半线的余数以及延长线上的两个平方。解释如下：甲乙：直线 甲乙 在 丙 处平分，然后延长至 乙丁。命题解释：甲丁：在直线 甲丁 和 乙丁 上，直线 甲丙 和 丙丁 上的两个平方大于直线 甲丙 和 丙丁 上的平方。证明如下：尝试从 丙戊 和 甲丙 在 丙 上画一条垂直线。从 戊 到 甲 再到 乙，在 丁 到 己丁 画一条竖线，然后从 戊乙 延长。当 戊乙 再次延长时，在 庚 画一条平行于 戊己 和 丙丁 的直线。最后，根据之前的论证画一条直线 甲庚。甲戊乙 是直角，丙戊乙 是半直角，即 戊庚己 对面也是半直角。〈一卷廿九〉 和 己 也是直角。〈一卷卅四〉 和 己戊庚 也是半直角。〈一卷卅二〉 和 己戊己庚 必须有相等的直角边。根据此 〈一卷〉〈六〉，乙丁丁庚 的两条直角边必须相等。甲戊 上的平方等于 甲丙丙戊 上的两个平方，而 〈一卷四七〉 必须是 甲丙 的两倍。如果上方平方等于 戊己己庚，那么两个上方平方与 〈一卷四七〉 必须大于 戊己 上的两个上方平方和上方平方 〈一卷卅四〉，则 甲戊戊庚 上两个平方的和大于 甲丙丙丁 上两个平方的和。同样，甲庚 上的平方等于 甲戊戊庚 上的两个平方，并且也等于 甲丁丁庚 上两个平方的和。则 甲丁丁庚 上两个平方的和也大于 甲丙丙丁 上两个平方的和。甲丁乙丁 上两个平方的和大于 甲丙丙丁 上两个平方的和。〈丁庚与乙丁等故〉 注意：通过使用数字来说明，十位数的和平均分为五，三的平方乘以九。如果三的平方是 169，并且三的平方大 9 倍，则五的平方是 25，八的平方是 64。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-10.source","contentId":"euclid-2-10","revisionId":"euclid-2-10@raw-45b9b3239d59ba4a","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7835eeba75e4cb0700b3d410d9a4eab082101b3ae1a873003d56df85a7540cfe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.10/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.10\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-10:euclid-1-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-10.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"I. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-10:euclid-1-3:explicit","sourceConten